OL,3,GNEWSABurst pipe leaves homes without
OL,4,Awater
OL,5,
OL,6,FA burst water main has left homes and
OL,7,Fbusinesses without water.
OL,9,FResidents and businesses, including
OL,10,Ffarms, near Ledbury in Herefordshire
OL,11,Fbegan reporting a lack of water during
OL,12,Fthe early hours of Saturday. Much
OL,13,FMarcle was one of the areas affected.
OL,15,FWelsh Water said there was a burst
OL,16,Fwater main affecting supplies in the
OL,17,FLedbury area. "We are aware of a burst
OL,18,Fon our network which is affecting
OL,19,Fsupplies to this area," it added.
OL,20,F"Until the pipe is fixed, you may
OL,21,Fexperience low pressure or no water."
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
