OL,3,GNEWSABurst pipe leaves homes without
OL,4,Awater
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said it expected supplies to be
OL,7,Frestored by late afternoon and
OL,8,Fapologised for any inconvenience
OL,9,Fcaused. Some residents on social media
OL,10,Freported water supplies getting back to
OL,11,Fnormal later in the day.
